cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use SocioVerse2, please cite the technical report below."
title: "SocioVerse2"
type: software
version: 0.2.0
date-released: "2026-09-25"
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/sii-research/SocioVerse2"
url: "https://socioverse.fudan-disc.com/"
abstract: >-
  SocioVerse2 is a longitudinal social-simulation framework. A fixed population of
  LLM agents with persistent ids lives through an environment that keeps changing,
  interventions and counterfactual branches are recorded as versions of the study,
  and every step is stored as panel data.
keywords:
  - social simulation
  - LLM agents
  - agent-based modeling
  - longitudinal
  - computational social science
authors:
  - name: "The SocioVerse2 Authors"
